Description: SupraLINUX system and desktop defaults
 Development settings package for the SupraLINUX Aurora baseline.
 .
 It owns persistent SupraLINUX defaults that must survive rebuilds. The initial
 implementation configures the SDDM greeter to run on KWin Wayland using KDE's
 supported Plasma integration path.
